Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, rise and shine, everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.48,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Good morning!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.48,0:00:11.49,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Greetings, all. It's Morioh Radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're listening to Mariah Radio.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.49,0:00:15.74,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Coming at you once again is yours truly, Kai Harada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai Harada here, keeping you\Ncompany on this beautiful morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.58,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Beautiful morning we're having, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day is shaping up to be a great one,\Nand I have just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.58,0:00:20.83,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}I have the perfect tune lined up here to start your day off right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sit back, relax, and enjoy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.83,0:00:23.21,Narrator,Radio,0,0,0,,{\an8}Have a listen to our first song of the morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you know, I'm a man of loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I never believe in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're back in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The reception usually clears\Nup once you're past the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, is this your\Nfirst time visiting Mario?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got anything to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In terms of recommendations?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the miso-marinated\Nbeef tongue is real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.08,0:01:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange incidents?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I don't know much when\Nit comes to oddball stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, would you kindly remind\Nme of your destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to the front of the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear this better not\Nbe what I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened in April 1999.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.93,0:02:08.27,Thoughts,Koichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}During April of 1999, on my first day\Nof high school, I met two very bizarre men.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.60,0:02:07.48,Title Part 4 Episode 1,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(563,646)\pos(132,873)\fs60}Episode 1: {\fs80} Jotaro Kujo! Meets Josuke Higashikata
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.60,0:02:07.48,Title Part 4 Episode 1,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(563,646)\pos(132,873)\fs(60)}Episode 1: {\fs(80)} Kujo Jotaro Meets Higashikata Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my first day of high school and I\Nwas about to make two very bizarre friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to become a high School and\Nwondered what the others would be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you were wondering,\Nmy name's Koichi Hirose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I guess it's not that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I was nervously\Nwalking myself to class when...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.49,0:02:21.53,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=9}{\blur0.6\bord4.44\fscx44.39\fscy34.14\pos(1026.68,430.25)\frz48.77\c&H010307&}Pow
