Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But didn't I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought all my stuff\Nwent flying everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.44,0:02:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I wasn't paying attention. A giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got to be over 190 centimeters tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe you can help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing, I've come here\Nto find the Higashkata family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higashikata?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.85,0:02:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe an address will jog your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Joseonji-16 ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can get to Joseonji pretty easily\Nby taking the number three bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before\Nanother one comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first guy that I met was Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later on, I found out he was 28\Nyears old and a marine explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,academics knew him best for his outstanding\Nresearch in the field of ecology.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's this fierceness about him,\Nbut he also seems really intellectual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you another freshman, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna introduce yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Koichi Hirose. Freshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.20,0:03:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's more like it, runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll find a different\Nbus and go about their business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, dickface?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you really must know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems this little turtle I found\Njust woke up from hibernation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But turtles give me the willies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes all my courage to\Neven touch their shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:04:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I thought today would be a good\Nday to finally conquer my fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buddy, does it look like I give a shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, you weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now, you've got some hype\Nfor such a pathetic freshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.34,0:04:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can dress like a puppet\Nfreak if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first you have to pay\Nyour respects to us, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you not do that, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reptiles really freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all so creepy.
