Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know how things were done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's kind of funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I've put a lot\Nof guys in the hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whose last words were\Nthe exact same as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to learn some respect, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to end up\Nlike this stupid turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this guy is heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, I'm feeling merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave your jacket and pants with\Nus, and you get to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your cash, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:04:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shaman had to go down this way, but\Nwhat did he expect in that get-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it pisses me off,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that he can just sit back and\Nwatch them pulverize a turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got an idea, pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell us your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Class 1B.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says Joe and Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you ask me, Jojo\Nhas a much better ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap and take\Noff the damn jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or didn't you notice the bus is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry it up, I swear to\NGod I'll chop off that fogly cowlick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but first...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you repeat what you\Njust said about my hair, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nose! My teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk shit about my hair and\Nyou'll see a different side of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A side that'll make you\Nfeel pain like never before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what was that about my hair\Nlooking like a motley toupee?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.47,0:06:15.47,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: "Sazae" is the titular character of a popular Japanese manga and animated TV series.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.47,0:06:15.47,Note,,0,0,0,,Note: "Sazae" is the titular character of a popular Japanese comic and animated TV series.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.42,0:06:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I heard,\Ndammit! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pump went flying through the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no denying what I just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the turtle's\Ncuts were never there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your nose and teeth\Nare healing themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that! He's fixed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess, but why\Nis his face all weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks totally different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've really done it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.26,0:06:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You made me touch something that\NI didn't want to lay a finger on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how exactly do you plan\Non making it up to me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my nose? Guys, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.18,0:07:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just that turtle again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow, the turtle's completely healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were born in the year 1983.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother's name is Tomoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was 21, attending university in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town's the only\Nhome you've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everything changed in 1987, when you\Ncame down with a mysterious fever at age 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 50 days, you were a\Nknockaway from death's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father's name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd I get mixed up in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of your father is Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's 78 now, and the\Nfounder of Joestar Realty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joseph Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that American real estate mogul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, the old man's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one day I was looking into\Nhow to divide his properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I discovered you, his\Nson, living right here in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the old man had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of shit that he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard always said his\Nwife was his one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I find out he had an affair\Nat the ripe old age of 62.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the product of it is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guess I shouldn't have said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means, since he's my grandfather,\NI'm technically your nephew. Bizarre, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nephew?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can talk on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, there you have it. Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to find yourself in possession\Nof a third of the old man's inheritance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the message I\Ncame here to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to lay this on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this affair has turned the\NJoestar family upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Er, upside down? Are you\Nserious? I am. My grandma,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Susie Q, is the angriest she's\Never been in their entire marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they've been together 61 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no need to freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing\Nin the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to be the cause of\Nthe family falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever the subject came up, Mom\Ntold me she was deeply in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that she had\Nthat is enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you tell my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need to concern\Nhimself with us. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here ready to be decked\Non behalf of the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But instead of being angry,\Nhe's the one apologizing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Josuke! Yeah, it is!\NHey, Josuke! What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to class together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hair is looking glorious as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so different from\Nthe other guys at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, but we're actually in\Nthe middle of an important chat, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry, you're\Ngonna be late for school!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can talk later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth to Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't finished our business yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the groupies out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.98,0:10:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can cackle like hens\Nabout his hair on your own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy has no idea the\Nbeast he's just released.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd he talk about his hair that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to repeat what\Nyou just said about my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one thing that sets Josuke off like\Nnothing else is someone insulting his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just what happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to take\Na shot at your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, here he comes!
