Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, no! He's bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see it, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:10:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is called a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a physical manifestation of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph has one of these as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.36,0:11:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a stand user can see another stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it pisses me off when someone\Ndecides to badmouth my pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really grinds my gears!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what his stand looks like.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.03,Note,,0,0,0,,TN: Dorarara is this Stand's Stand Cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid's power is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know if you realize this, nephew,\Nbut you left your chest wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Hugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouths and\Nget the hell out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before your whiny\Nbitching makes me angrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's kind of scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but in a hot way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wrap my head around any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten years to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only managed to stop\Ntime for half a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt we would have killed\Neach other if I hadn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it would have gotten\Nugly for one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can manage on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, there's another\Nreason I came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.22,0:12:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something evil is lurking in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A catastrophic danger is\Nclosing in as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the old man used his psychic\Nphotography to get a picture of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this was the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know who this guy is, but if I\Nhad to guess, I'd say he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is all new to you, but\NI wanted to show you the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.16,0:12:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, if you ever run into\Nhim, get as far away as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting the police involved won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just haul ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you find yourself face to face with\Nhim, keep your cool and stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or it'll be a repeat\Nof what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our orientation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It started!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom is gonna kill me if I show\Nup late for my first day of school!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I need to get going,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I promise to listen to whatever\Nyou have to say after school, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Koichi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.78,0:13:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put some pep in your step!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the other bizarre\Nfriends I made that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second he's a wallflower, the\Nnext he's acting like a crazy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got some family drama going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one way to make a first impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's a strange one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that my hat isn't\Ncurrently ripped all hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must be able to destroy objects\Nand rearrange their structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he'd managed to connect\Nwith my face or my skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he could be a potential ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already a more than capable fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excluding his fickle personality, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I'm really hoping this mess\Ndoesn't have anything to do with Josuke.
