Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, good looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you where you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be shy, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't bite much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, lady, you're a total knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you'll\Ngo wherever I want, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had better believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just say the word and I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you take\Na one-way trip to hell, douchebag?
