Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got here just in time\Nto catch that crazy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She assaulted me! Sorry, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That woman is my daughter. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in addition to\Nbeing a public nuisance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you also referred to my\Nbaby girl as a crazy bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'd watch myself if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.74,0:15:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you off with a warning,\Nbut you're on thin ice, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear, Madame Murakami,\Nhow are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry this so you can take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fancy seeing you here, Tomoko. Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your way home? Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all done with my shift for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Josuke doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's his orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.38,0:15:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy had better not\Nbe getting into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows with that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:16:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks innocent, but the moron\Nloses it at the drop of a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where he gets that from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep in his heart of hearts, he's\Nan honest-to-goodness sweetie pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not too worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.82,0:16:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about having\Na big celebration tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was actually my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt he'll come straight home, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That child of mine likes his detours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to stop by Kameyu, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just bought you an\Nexpensive bag, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, baby, I want to\Nlook at clothes today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.84,0:16:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention to where\Nyou're walking, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freak show gave me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of moron slams into\Nsomeone and doesn't apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just get out of here, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, you're still\Nangling for Kameyu, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo Katagiri, a .k. a. Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.78,0:17:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was born in Morioh in\N1964 and has an IQ of 160.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sent to Juvie for robbery and\Nrape when he was only 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the beginning of his depravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He earned a reputation for\Nbeing the most violent,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,abominable criminal to\Never walk on Japanese soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of his youth was spent in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time he turned 34, he'd\Nalready spent 20 years in the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final crime he ever committed was so\Nreprehensible, he'd make a sewer rat puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was eventually arrested,\Nand then executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately for all\Ninvolved, the execution
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.20,0:17:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angelo escaped from custody shortly after,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he most likely became a Stand user\Nright before his execution I'm not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why but he's now hiding in the shadows\Nof this quiet town and I have no idea
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where oh hey Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you headed home uh
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah guess so so we're classmates yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what a coincidence well I'll catch you\Ntomorrow have a good evening hey uh Josuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can you wait a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to hear what that\NJotaro guy has to say, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get it out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening in our backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admirable of you to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll pass. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lie, I was curious\Nabout the whole thing at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when I thought about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it'd be best to keep clear\Nof this whole love-child fiasco.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, things are fine the way they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so in my opinion, why try\Nto fix what ain't broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's some kind of accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go and check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.18,0:18:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This area's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to get back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolute chaos over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some man went to rob\Nthat convenience store
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's taken the\Nfemale employee hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! He's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put down the knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let the girl go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get the hell back, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.62,0:19:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I recognize that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been my cashier a couple of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by his eyes, if he actually snaps,\Nhe'll kill her without any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.02,0:19:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.85,0:19:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the car and\Nleaving this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here\Nbefore things get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're probably you over\Nthere with a dumb shit hairdo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told your ass to get away from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:19:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I knew it!
