Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Jotaro warned him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the devil is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand down and back away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you\Njust say about my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you think you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you don't start walking,\NI'm gonna gun her like a fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.87,0:20:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that guy snaps, you're a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for you too, now get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.40,0:20:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had all I'm gonna take!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna freakin' do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna slaughter this bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yorah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two have a hole\Nthrough their bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't piss you off, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.24,0:20:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I should be the\None who's ticked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a mark on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's back to normal, like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My knife's inside my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did my knife get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest finding a surgeon to\Nremove that in the prison hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly, let's cuff this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on around here? Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Koichi? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears another annoying\Nstand user has joined the fray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was having so much fun using\Nthat meat puppet for my armed robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, you had to\Nget in my way. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's from the picture, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you know I'm going to\Nkeep a close eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever you are, whatever you do,\NI'll be nearby watching and waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say, water boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:21:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could've been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro was telling the truth all along.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.31,0:22:21.06,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lemme go! I did nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's happening in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if I\Ncan feel it in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever found its way\Ninto Mariah... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.10,0:22:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, can you get the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer the damn phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, don't have\Na cow, I'm getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.76,0:22:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Jotsuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.00,0:22:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our conversation yesterday was too brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to talk about the\Nguy hiding in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I wanted to talk about that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:22:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You staying somewhere in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.18,0:23:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at the Mariah Grand Hotel for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.72,0:23:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this really pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did I put that damn shovel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.22,0:23:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.26,0:23:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's living the high life with\Nhis perfect little family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.94,0:23:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's even got a hot young mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.48,0:23:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that he could appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.28,0:23:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's such a lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.52,0:23:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better not get too\Ncocky, you little pissant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm going to stamp your\Nsoul and your precious little life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get to have my fun after all.
